    "https://jobs.rowan.edu/en-us/job/501728/adjunct-professor-marketing-management-information-systems-and-supply-chain-department-of-marketing-and-business-information-systems": {
      "title": "Adjunct Professor, Marketing, Management Information Systems, and Supply Chain - Department of Marketing and Business Information Systems",
      "description": "Adjunct Professor, Marketing, Management Information Systems, and Supply Chain - Department of Marketing and Business Information Systems Apply now Job no: 501728 Work type: Temporary Part-Time Location: Glassboro, New Jersey Categories: Faculty - College of Business Adjunct Professors of Marketing, Management Information Systems and Supply Chain sought for Rohrer College of Business, Marketing and Business Information Systems Department. The AACSB-accredited Rohrer College of Business (RCB) has approximately 2,400 undergraduate students and 145 masters' level students and is experiencing a period of unprecedented programmatic and enrollment growth. Adjunct professors are needed to teach undergraduate and/or graduate courses in the areas of Marketing, Supply Chain, Database, Data Analytics, E-Business, Information Security, and Management Information Systems, with availability to teach in the day and/or evening. Qualifications: A master's degree in business, or related area, with at least five years of recent and relevant professional experience is required. Teaching experience is strongly preferred, as well as experience teaching in both a traditional classroom and online format. Start Date: September 1, 2026 and ongoing To Apply: Applications must be submitted through our online application system and should include a cover letter and resume. Applications will not be accepted by e-mail. The cover letter should include statements regarding teaching experience, qualifications, and areas of teaching interest. All positions are contingent upon budget appropriations. Note: Candidates must be eligible to work in the United States. The University will not sponsor a visa for this position. In compliance with The State of New Jersey's Pay Transparency Act, and in accordance with the current MOA, Rowan University adjuncts are provided with a minimum of $2,225 per credit for all courses taught, with a maximum teaching load of 8 credits per semester and 12 credits in an academic year. Courses will be assigned to instructors by College & Department on an as-needed basis. Advertised: Aug 5 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Applications close: Jun 30 2027 11:55 PM Eastern Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App"
