    "https://jobs.rowan.edu/en-us/job/501609/adjunct-faculty-department-of-management": {
      "title": "Adjunct Faculty,  Department of Management",
      "description": "Adjunct Faculty, Department of Management Apply now Job no: 501609 Work type: Temporary Part-Time Location: Glassboro, New Jersey Categories: Faculty - College of Business Adjunct Professors of Management Sought for Rohrer College of Business, Management Department The AACSB-accredited Rohrer College of Business (RCB) has approximately 2,400 undergraduate students and 145 masters' level students and is experiencing a period of unprecedented programmatic and enrollment growth. Adjunct professors are needed to teach undergraduate and graduate courses in the areas of International Business, Organizational Behavior and Strategic Management with availability to teach in the day and/or evening. Qualifications: A master's degree in business, or related areas, with at least five years of recent and relevant professional experience is required. Teaching experience is strongly preferred. To Apply: Applications must be submitted through our online application system, which can be found at jobs.rowan.edu. Candidates should submit: cover letter curriculum vitae graduate transcripts names and contact information of three reference Salary: In compliance with The State of New Jersey's Pay Transparency Act, and in accordance with the current MOA, Rowan University adjuncts are provided with a minimum of $2,225 (after 9/1/2026) per credit for all courses taught, with a maximum teaching load of 8 credits per semester and 12 credits in an academic year. Courses will be assigned to instructors by College & Department on an as-needed basis. All positions are contingent upon budget appropriations. Advertised: Jul 1 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Applications close: Jun 30 2027 11:55 PM Eastern Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App"
