    "https://jobs.rowan.edu/en-us/job/501593/adjunct-faculty-department-of-biological-sciences": {
      "title": "Adjunct Faculty - Department of Biological Sciences",
      "description": "Adjunct Faculty - Department of Biological Sciences Apply now Job no: 501593 Work type: Temporary Part-Time Location: Glassboro, New Jersey Categories: Faculty - College of Science and Mathematics The Department of Biological & Biomedical Sciences (BBS) is seeking qualified adjunct faculty to teach a variety of courses for both majors and non-majors. Courses include (but are not limited to) anatomy & physiology, genetics, cell biology, ecology, and microbiology, as well as general biology for non-science majors. Teaching appointments will be in the Fall 2025 and/or the Spring 2026 semesters. See the Department website (https://csm.rowan.edu/departments/bbs) for more information. Qualifications: Master’s degree required in a subdiscipline of biology or a field of science clearly related to the course being taught. Preference will be given to applicants with previous teaching experience, experience with learning management systems (our campus uses Canvas), favorable recommendations from references, and favorable previous teaching evaluations. Starting Date: September 2026 for Fall 2026 semester, January 2027 for Spring 2027 semester. Applications must be submitted through our online application system and should include a cover letter, current curriculum vita, and unofficial transcripts for the highest degree. Applications will not be accepted by e-mail. The cover letter should include statements regarding teaching experience, qualifications, and areas of teaching interest. Applications will be accepted until all positions are filled, and all positions are contingent upon budget appropriations. Rowan University is committed to equal opportunity in employment. Note: Candidates must be eligible to work in the United States. The University will not sponsor a visa for this position. In compliance with The State of New Jersey's Pay Transparency Act , and in accordance with the current MOA, Rowan University adjuncts are provided with a minimum of $2,225 per credit for all courses taught, with a maximum teaching load of 8 credits per semester and 12 credits in an academic year. Courses will be assigned to instructors by College & Department on an as-needed basis. Advertised: Jun 26 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Applications close: Jun 30 2027 11:55 PM Eastern Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App"
